### Check first
Open [this component](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/highlights) and its [metrics](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/metrics). Inspect reconcile errors and the affected InferenceService conditions. The configured threshold is **{{threshold}}** in the monitor chart's unit.

### Likely causes
Invalid serving configuration, unavailable dependencies or resource constraints.

### Fix
Correct the reported reconciliation error and confirm the desired serving configuration.

### Verify
Reconcile error ratio falls below the threshold and affected services become ready. If samples are absent, investigate the exporter and Collector: this threshold check cannot establish healthy operation without data.
